<title>USA: Union Pacific Corp Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Corp Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>LEHIGH VALLEY, Pa. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.52		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			128,000		   78,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,810,000		2,748,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 247,800		  244,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '96 results are pro forma, reflecting purchase of Southern Pacific Rail Corp, spinoff of Union Pacific Resources Group, as if both transactions completed on Jan 1, 96.</p>
<p>'97 Q1 includes one-time pre-tax merger expenses $15 million.</p>
<p>'97 Q1 oper shr $0.56.</p>
</text>
